{"path":"ranges/subrange/prev","title":"std::ranges::subrange<I,S,K>::prev","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::ranges::subrange&lt;I,S,K&gt;::</span>prev","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/ranges/subrange/prev","section":"ranges","kind":"page","summary":"Returns a copy of *this whose begin_ is decremented (or incremented if n is negative). The actual decrement (or increment) operation is performed by advance().","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> subrange prev<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/iter_t\"><span class=\"kw2893\">std::<span class=\"me2\">iter_difference_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>I<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> n <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span> <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; requires <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/bidirectional_iterator\"><span class=\"kw2885\">std::<span class=\"me2\">bidirectional_iterator</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>I<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns a copy of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> whose <code><i><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/subrange#begin\">begin_</a></i></code> is decremented (or incremented if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">n</span></code> is negative). The actual decrement (or increment) operation is performed by <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/subrange/advance\"><code>advance()</code></a>.\n</p><p>Equivalent to:<code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> tmp <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span><br><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">tmp.<span class=\"me1\">advance</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span>n<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span><br><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">return</span> tmp<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> n\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> number of decrements of the iterator\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>As described above.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>The difference between this function and <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/subrange/advance\"><code>advance()</code></a> is that the latter performs the decrement (or increment) in place.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iterator&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;list&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;print&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;ranges&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/list\"><span class=\"kw1283\">std::<span class=\"me2\">list</span></span></a> list<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">4</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">5</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/subrange\"><span class=\"kw2928\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">subrange</span></span></a> sub<span class=\"br0\">{</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/next\"><span class=\"kw679\">std::<span class=\"me2\">next</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>list.<span class=\"me1\">begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/prev\"><span class=\"kw680\">std::<span class=\"me2\">prev</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>list.<span class=\"me1\">end</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/println\"><span class=\"kw3402\">std::<span class=\"me2\">println</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"{} {} {}\"</span>, sub, sub.<span class=\"me1\">prev</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, sub.<span class=\"me1\">prev</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>[3] [2, 3] [1, 2, 3]</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/subrange/next\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>next</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  obtains a copy of the <code>subrange</code> with its iterator advanced by a given distance <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/subrange/advance\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>advance</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  advances the iterator by given distance <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/prev\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>prev</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  decrement an iterator <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/ranges/prev\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>ranges::prev</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td> decrement an iterator by a given distance or to a bound<br><span class=\"t-mark\">(algorithm function object)</span></td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"ranges","title":"Ranges library (since C++20)"},{"path":"ranges/subrange","title":"std::ranges::subrange"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::ranges::subrange<I,S,K>::prev","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++20. Returns a copy of *this whose begin_ is decremented (or incremented if n is negative)."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"n"},{"label":"Return value","note":"As described above."},{"label":"Notes","note":"The difference between this function and advance() is that the latter performs the decrement (or increment) in place."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"next","note":"obtains a copy of the subrange with its iterator advanced by a given distance"},{"label":"advance","note":"advances the iterator by given distance"},{"label":"prev","note":"decrement an iterator"},{"label":"ranges::prev","note":"decrement an iterator by a given distance or to a bound"}]}]},"standards":["C++11","C++20"],"wordCount":164,"codeBlockCount":2}
